SUMMARY:Sonoma Cares Gala
DESCRIPTION:Audacity Rising Inc. and VIDAS law group proudly present our first grand Gala dinner and fundraising event. We are raising money to benefit the marginalized and immigrant communities to help with legal services and representation as well as family support and funding services for our neighbors in need of help. The event will feature an exceptional meal and wine selection and a silent auction. The festivities will be entertained by a stellar lineup of renowned musicians and some local heroes to regale the crowd while they dine and celebrate our diverse culture and wonderful community spirit. The Freidman Event Center will host our Gala in a remarkably beautiful facility that will set the tone for a memorable evening and a lasting contribution to strengthening our unity and uplifting our spirits as a caring and unified people.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/sonoma-cares-gala/
LOCATION:Friedman Event Center\, 4676 Mayette Ave.\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music,Other
GEO:38.4438;-122.666
