SUMMARY:Pro Jam with Special Guest Fillmore Slim
DESCRIPTION:The Godfather of Hip Hop brings his unique music style and vibrant live performance!\nThe dude is complex. He’s a love bandit\, Cadillac craver\, sidewalk poet\, pimp extraordinaire\, ex-con\, eager entertainer\, velvet-wrapped urban legend\, and\, above all\, bluesman. Fillmore Slim is all that. T-Bone\, B.B.\, and compadre Johnny Guitar Watson could vouch for him. Ice-T\, Ice Cube and Snoop Dogg have name-checked him. Etta James called him her first boyfriend. Others still call him the Godfather of Hip Hop or the West Coast Godfather of the Game. He’s bucked the straight and narrow. He’s lived to transcribe it (the tell-all Blues Man Mack: How I Conquered the Stage and the Streets)\, but more often sing about it. \nDoors open at 5:00pm. Tickets $15 online. $18 at door. $12 for members.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/pro-jam-with-special-guest-fillmore-slim/
LOCATION:The California Theatre of Santa Rosa\, 528 7th Street\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://golocal.coop/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Fillmore-Slim.jpg
GEO:38.44252;-122.71621
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=The California Theatre of Santa Rosa 528 7th Street Santa Rosa CA;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=528 7th Street:geo:-122.71621,38.44252
END:VEVENT
