SUMMARY:Russian River Pride 2026 Beneficiary Awards Dinner
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an evening of celebration in the beautiful Highland Dell Lodge. Attendees will enjoy a cocktail hour (cash bar) with passed hors d’oeuvres\, followed by a buffet dinner with salads\, a main entree (vegetarian option)\, sides\, and dessert. Wine is included with dinner. \nThe Russian River Pride Board of Directors are pleased to present $25\,000 in awards to eight worthwhile West Sonoma County non-profits who support our community every day:\nHugs Grief Group\, Monte Rio Chamber of Commerce\, Solar Punk Farms\, Ruthless Kindness\, Friends of Monte Rio\, Russian River Youth Center\, Russian River Keeper\, and the Russian River Chamber of Commerce and Visitor Center.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/russian-river-pride-2026-beneficiary-awards-dinner/
LOCATION:Highland Dell Lodge\, 21050 River Blvd.\, Monte Rio\, CA
CATEGORIES:Other
