SUMMARY:Cardinal Newman High School Modern Rock Band
DESCRIPTION:Modern Rock Band at Newman is more than just a class—it’s a hands-on music experience where students choose their songs\, collaborate on arrangements\, and bring their passion to life on stage. Through this process\, they build skills that will stay with them long after high school.\nJoin us for a night of incredible live music as students take the stage\, performing the songs they know and love.
