SUMMARY:Hardly Strictly Irish at Rio Nido Roadhouse
DESCRIPTION:Rio Nido Roadhouse is all about great music\, good food\, and laid-back Russian River energy among the towering Redwoods. \nHARDLY STRICTLY IRISH (Suzuki Cady & Jimmy Murphy) play lovely\, lively traditional Irish tunes and sing soulful songs from a variety of genres on fiddle\, mandolin\, guitar\, and bodhrán. \n“A new\, local band is rocking the Bay Area—to high acclaim…They are commensurate acoustic musicians with decades of experience between them.” – Mark Fernquest\, Sebastopol Times \nHARDLY STRICTLY IRISH: suzukicady.com/hardly-strictly-irish\nVIDEOS: suzukicady.com/videos\nSHOWS: suzukicady.com/events\nPRESS: suzukicady.com/press
