SUMMARY:Spring Fling Wine Walk
DESCRIPTION:Windsor Spring Fling Wine Walk 2026\nThursday\, April 30th\n5:00 – 8:00 pm \nJoin us for our Annual Spring Fling Wine Walk event\, showcasing the delightful businesses of Windsor on the Town Green\, and celebrating the start of the Spring season! Just in time for Mother’s Day\, attendees will have the chance to wander from store to store\, savoring delicious wine while shopping for gifts. Enjoy live music by local band The AJ’s and a mobile photo booth. It’s a fantastic opportunity to engage with the community and support our local businesses. \nOver 20 participating stores\, businesses and Windsor non-profits will pour local Sonoma County wines. Some will serve food bites too! Enjoy a leisurely stroll as you relax\, sip\, and shop – what better way to spend a spring evening? \nA portion of the proceeds will benefit Windsor High School Project Grad and their mission to give our graduates a safe\, sober\, and memorable grad night. \nRegistration today! With only 400 tickets available for this beloved event\, be sure to secure yours now. \nWe can’t wait to celebrate with you!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/spring-fling-wine-walk/
LOCATION:Windsor Town Green\, 701 McClelland Dr.\, Windsor\, CA
CATEGORIES:Other
GEO:38.5488;-122.815
