SUMMARY:The Loralee Christensen Combo at Brewsters
DESCRIPTION:Loralee Christensen has been performing and recording for over 30 years. Through the years\, her powerful\, soulful\, multi-faceted and versatile voice has kept her consistently busy both live and in the recording studio. Her range as a vocalist is truly impressive. She can go from a soulful\, raucous\, growling Big Mama Thornton to a sexy\, sultry\, smooth Julie London or a powerful\, gutsy\, rocking Linda Ronstadt to a sweet\, sensitive\, tender Emmylou Harris in an instant.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/the-loralee-christensen-combo-at-brewsters/
